<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Boletines - Sistema Academico</title>
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0-alpha1/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <link href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0-alpha1/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js" defer></script>
    <script src="/js/main.js" defer></script>
    <script src="/js/boletines.js" defer></script>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container-fluid vh-100 d-flex flex-column">
        <header class="bg-primary text-white p-3 shadow">
            <div class="container d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center">
                <h1 class="h4 mb-0"><i class="fas fa-file-invoice me-2"></i>Boletines</h1>
                <a href="/" class="btn btn-outline-light btn-sm"><i class="fas fa-home"></i> Menú</a>
            </div>
        </header>
        <main class="flex-grow-1 overflow-auto py-3">
            <div class="container">
                <div class="alert alert-secondary">
                    <i class="fas fa-info-circle me-2"></i>
                    <strong>Boletines:</strong> Esta sección está pendiente de desarrollo. Próximamente podrá generar y visualizar boletines de notas completos.
                </div>

                <div class="row g-3">
                    <div class="col-md-3">
                        <div class="card border-success h-100">
                            <div class="card-body text-center">
                                <i class="fas fa-file-pdf fa-2x text-danger mb-3"></i>
                                <h5 class="card-title">Boletin Individual</h5>
                                <p class="card-text text-muted">Generar boletin para un estudiante especifico</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-md-3">
                        <div class="card border-info h-100">
                            <div class="card-body text-center">
                                <i class="fas fa-file-export fa-2x text-info mb-3"></i>
                                <h5 class="card-title">Boletin por Grupo</h5>
                                <p class="card-text text-muted">Generar boletines para todo un grupo</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-md-3">
                        <div class="card border-warning h-100">
                            <div class="card-body text-center">
                                <i class="fas fa-print fa-2x text-warning mb-3"></i>
                                <h5 class="card-title">Imprimir</h5>
                                <p class="card-text text-muted">Imprimir boletines en PDF</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-md-3">
                        <div class="card border-primary h-100">
                            <div class="card-body text-center">
                                <i class="fas fa-file-invoice fa-2x text-primary mb-3"></i>
                                <h5 class="card-title">Resumen General</h5>
                                <p class="card-text text-muted">Resumen de notas general del curso</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </main>
        <footer class="bg-light text-center p-2 border-top">
            <small class="text-muted">&copy; 2026 Sistema de Gestion Academica</small>
        </footer>
    </div>
</body>
</html>